note Concatenate repaired bw_enc_sm121 and bw_spec_sm121 unchanged before this adapter.
note One instruction representation and encoder; sp_enc independently validates solved semantics.
fn bc_encode ins view ulong 8192 phys view ulong 288 n ulong pad ulong code edit uchar 16384 to ulong
o = new ulong 16 0
w = new ulong 4 0
if or eq n 0 gt n 1024
ret 0
end
for i ulong n
opnds ins i phys o
if ne sp_enc o w 0
ret 0
end
end
ret bw_enc_sm121 ins phys n pad code
end
